Xenia canary 9e9d3cdd3f ("Clamp out-of-bounds vertex fetch words to 0", Aug 2026, with Herman S.):
vertex fetch words at or past the size in the fetch constant read as 0, as on the hardware, instead
of unrelated guest memory. Suspected for the black blotches on animated faces in Gears of War 3
cutscenes. gpu_vfetch_bounds (default true) turns it off for comparison.

--- a/src/graphics/flags.cpp
+++ b/src/graphics/flags.cpp
@@ -15,6 +15,9 @@
 
 REXCVAR_DEFINE_BOOL(gpu_allow_invalid_fetch_constants, false, "GPU",
                     "Allow invalid fetch constants");
+REXCVAR_DEFINE_BOOL(gpu_vfetch_bounds, true, "GPU",
+                    "Vertex fetch words past the end of the fetch constant's buffer read as 0 (hardware "
+                    "behaviour, Xenia 9e9d3cdd3f); false reads whatever guest memory follows");
 REXCVAR_DEFINE_BOOL(native_2x_msaa, true, "GPU", "Enable native 2x MSAA");
 REXCVAR_DEFINE_BOOL(depth_float24_round, false, "GPU", "Round float24 depth values");
